From zedha-brand-v1.12.0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] Brand stable macOS build as Zedha

Keep product identity separate from terminal launcher behavior so either
concern can be refreshed or removed independently.

Generated against Zed v1.12.0 (f96212f2c50f54d93712fa130d6226b1ce7d76b5).
---

